stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> NEW : employee reports
  NEW --> CLASSIFIED : classify()  [category + priority + SLA applied]
  CLASSIFIED --> ASSIGNED : assign(technician)  [strategy or manual]
  ASSIGNED --> ACKNOWLEDGED : acknowledge()  [response SLA stamped]
  ASSIGNED --> ASSIGNED : assign()  [reassign / escalation]
  ACKNOWLEDGED --> IN_PROGRESS : startInvestigation()
  ACKNOWLEDGED --> ASSIGNED : assign()  [reassign]
  IN_PROGRESS --> PENDING_INFO : requestInfo()
  PENDING_INFO --> IN_PROGRESS : provideInfo()  [reporter replies]
  IN_PROGRESS --> RESOLVED : resolve(resolution)  [resolution SLA evaluated]
  IN_PROGRESS --> ASSIGNED : assign()  [reassign]
  RESOLVED --> VERIFIED : verify()  [reporter confirms]
  RESOLVED --> IN_PROGRESS : reopen()  [reporter rejects]
  RESOLVED --> CLOSED : close()  [admin only]
  VERIFIED --> CLOSED : close()  [reporter or admin]
  CLOSED --> [*]
  note right of NEW : Any other call (e.g. close(), resolve()) throws InvalidStateTransitionException
